OL,3,AToxic haze from wildfires spreads
OL,4,Aacross South East Asia as 'super' El
OL,5,ANino intensifies
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndonesia is battling massive
OL,8,Fwildfires, some of which have been
OL,9,Fburning for weeks - BBC teams are
OL,10,Fcovering the disaster from the
OL,11,Fworst-hit areas
OL,13,FMillions of people in Sumatra and the
OL,14,FIndonesian portion of Borneo island,
OL,15,FKalimantan, have been exposed to toxic
OL,16,Fhaze from the fires. The haze has also
OL,17,Fspread to neighbouring Malaysia, and
OL,18,Ffarther north in the Philippines
OL,20,FThousands of people in Indonesia have
OL,21,Fbeen admitted to hospital with
OL,22,Frespiratory infections
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
